OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FClear spells
OL,6,Fand scattered showers in the evening,
OL,7,Fthese showers becoming light and more
OL,8,Fisolated overnight. Fresh westerly
OL,9,Fwinds at first will ease through the
OL,10,Fnight.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FBright with sunny spells and
OL,13,Fisolated light showers in the morning,
OL,14,Fbecoming dry in the afternoon. Turning
OL,15,Fcloudy in the evening with some rain.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
