OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FWindy
OL,6,Fwith some showers, or rain later, on
OL,7,FSunday. Bright start Monday then
OL,8,Foccasionally heavy rain or showers and
OL,9,Fbecoming windy. Windy Tuesday with
OL,10,Foccasionally heavy rain or showers.
